{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"136687","name":"55 Hotel Montparnasse","description":"يرحب بكم فندق 55 Montparnasse ذو الـ 3 نجوم في قلب الدائرة الرابعة عشرة التاريخية في باريس، في منطقة مونبارناس. استكشف المتاجر التقليدية والمخابز في المنطقة، واستمتع بسهولة الوصول إلى برج ومحطة مونبارناس، التي تبعد ٥٠٠ متر فقط. تم تزيين غرف الفندق الأربعين المريحة بذوق رفيع، وهي مجهزة بتلفزيون مع قنوات فضائية وخدمة الواي فاي ومجفف شعر. يُرجى الملاحظة: ضريبة المدينة غير مشمولة في السعر اعتبارًا من ١ يوليو ٢٠١٥.","address":"Rue De Plaisance, 55","city":"PARIS","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"75014","lat":48.83358310000001,"lng":2.3177598,"stars":3,"giataCode":"108232","phone":"+0033147855000","email":"info@55montparnasse.com","website":"https://www.55montparnasse.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_a_020.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_w_008.jpg","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_w_006.jpg","category":"room","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_w_007.jpg","category":"room","order":8},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_w_001.jpg","category":"room","order":9},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/13/136687/136687a_hb_w_002.jpg","categ